      "description": "SMOOTH MOISTURIZING BODY LOTION FOR NORMAL SKIN\n\nFormulated especially for Normal Skin, Creme 21’s Smooth Moisturizing Body Lotion is made with Pro-Vitamin B5 which works as a natural skin healer and protector. The formulation also helps restore the skin’s balance and moisture levels which is vital for healthy and happy skin.\n\n\nAbout this item \nMADE IN GERMANY: standards, Cruelty Free: No testing on animals; SOFT MOISTURIZING BODY LOTION: The rich creamy lotion gets easily absorbed without any sticky or greasy feel making your skin look naturally healthy. Makes skin touchably and visibly soft and supple \nMOISTURISES AND PROTECTS THE SKIN: Crème 21 dry skin protects your skin from dehydration and adds vitamins. Emollients softens especially dry skin and protects it from harmful environmental effects \nWHAT MAKE CRÈME 21 SO GOOD: Enriched with Vitamin E and natural Aloe Vera it deeply nourishes and soothes dry skin. It is Free from Parabens, Sulphates, Parrafins, Silicones and Microplastics \nSUITABLE FOR DRY SKIN: This body lotion is perfectly suited for dry skin and for both men and women \nTarget Gender: Unisex \nMADE IN GERMANY: standarNo testing on animals; SOFT MOISTURIThe rich creamy lotion gets easily absorbed without any sticky or greasy feel making your skin look naturally healthy. Makes skin touchably and visibly soft and supple",
